Usage: hops project [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  List and switch Hopsworks projects.

Options:
  --json / --no-json      Force JSON / force human tables (default: JSON when
                          piped).
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  info  Print details about the currently active project.
  list  Show every project the current user can access.
  use   Switch the default project to ``name`` and cache its identifiers.
